<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB consortium wins Argentine deal.</title>
<headline>ABB consortium wins Argentine deal.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABB Asea Brown Boveri Ltd said a consortium to which it belonged had won an order to build a 775-megawatt combined-cycle power plant in Argentina.</p>
<p>The ABB share is about half of the $235 million order, which was placed by Central Dock Sud SA, it said in a statement.</p>
